@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000

### 1. List submissions
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/submissions
Accept: application/json

### 2. OpenAPI document
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi/v1.json
Accept: application/json

### 3. Create a submission (save the returned id as createSubmission)
# @name createSubmission
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentName": "Nguyen Van A",
  "assignmentName": "Bai tap SignalR"
}

### 4. Read the created submission
@submissionId = {{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/submissions/{{submissionId}}
Accept: application/json

### 5. Reject a missing student name
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentName": " ",
  "assignmentName": "Bai tap SignalR"
}

### 6. Reject a missing assignment name
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentName": "Nguyen Van A",
  "assignmentName": ""
}

### 7. Return 404 for an unknown submission
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/submissions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json

### 8. Reject null request fields
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentName": null,
  "assignmentName": "Bai tap SignalR"
}

### 9. SignalR negotiate endpoint
POST {{baseUrl}}/hubs/submissions/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1
Content-Length: 0
